// ENDGAME_LAMBDASECTOR_DOORGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4084407060" "Stand back."

// ENDGAME_LAMBDASECTOR_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2115053025" "Initiate takedown protocols!"

// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P3852818335" "Push them back, men!"
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P482315074" "We must hold this door!"
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P1120279712" "Look sharp, here comes some more!"
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P1010736122" "Backup, we need backup!"
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P148271075" "Quickly, we cannot let Tub Ci escape!"
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P1624340297" "Powers Division. Just what we needed."
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P584964505" "Put down your weapons or you will be disarmed forcefully."
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P3787322527" "Marcus Cole will not tolerate organized crime. Consider this your eviction notice."
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P3695140413" "Hold this position, we have them surrounded."
// ZE_PPD_BATTLING_SYNDICATE_AT_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P2641572592" "They cannot escape."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2096510034" "A bit of trouble over at Gravatech Labs.  Again.  I swear, that place gets more activity than the CTA."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2493180136" "Another protest last week, huh?  I don't get these people.  No gratitude, you know?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2421372043" "No, his transfer isn't until tomorrow.  He's in a holding cell cooling off."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3561133062" "Another psych assessment at Mother Mercy next week.  Third one this week."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2896064255" "He was just promoted to Warrant Officer.  Sweet deal."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3045328335" "Nah, the Sergeant was really good about it.  First mistake is a mistake.  Second mistake is a demotion, though."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3796267996" "Were you on the call for the breakin at Novahold last week?  What happened?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3806520265" "I know she's his girl, but that Cleopatra is something else.  I'm just saying."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P507600198" "You know what assignment I'd like?  I'd like to break up one of those protests.  Now that would be some good exercise."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1513322908" "No, things got a little out of hand.  They transferred him over to Cole Memorial.  Goes with the job."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2677612649" "No, you let them get in a hit free and then you have full recourse to take whatever violence deemed necessary to subdue them.  Who told you you could hit first?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3257028134" "I saw one of them punch a Clockwork robot in the face.  I don't want to be mean, but how stupid is that?  Uh...metal."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2193795422" "Where is Calvin Scott?!?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3092319105" "Don't continue, Citizen, or you'll only bring our wrath on yourself."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2149608080" "Don't try anything Citizen. It will be a big mistake."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P781682537" "Persist in your harassment, Citizen, and we have orders to deliver you to the Praetors for interrogation."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ALLEYWAY_LOITER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4021506412" "Cease and desist, Citizen, or you will be subdued!"



// NOVAPRAETORIA_PPD_ALLEYWAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1875683305" "After this shift ends, how about we head out for a snack?  All this walking has made me hungry."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_PPD_ALLEYWAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2655464530" "If we're lucky, we'll find some Resistance members to arrest.  The sooner we clean the city of them, the sooner it'll be safe for our citizens."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_PPD_ALLEYWAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2525615324" "I'm not walking too fast.  You need to keep up."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_PPD_ALLEYWAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2207907661" "This is as fast as I walk.  That's it."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_PPD_ALLEYWAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1410728626" "Time goes by faster when patrolling in groups.  Thank goodness Emperor Cole upped our shift numbers."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_PPD_ALLEYWAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P514073817" "I wish we were patrolling the Underground.  It's always 'interesting' down there."


// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P459164841" "I'll be out in a day."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2199246050" "You have nothing on me and you know it."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1711881882" "I still haven't heard a charge, Officer."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1704379153" "Is this going to be another one of those police brutality sagas?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P900299885" "It's all a sham and you know it."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3713249644" "This is ridiculous."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1650390449" "I'm a bird.  You can't cage me!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2020872103" "I told you!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P776466538" "Freedom wins!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4096017988" "Better luck next time!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPDSTAYTHERE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P488554915" "Don't move.  This is your only warning."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPDSTAYTHERE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3353326017" "Why must you guys always make this so much work?  Just stay put.  No one has to get winded here."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPDSTAYTHERE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1660271862" "I don't think I have to tell you that if you move, things will go badly for you."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPDSTAYTHERE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1376775080" "Be smart.  Don't move."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPDSTAYTHERE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P37054663" "You know the drill.  Don't move or this gets physical."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_PPD_INITIATEPICKUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P665370182" "Arrange for transport to booking.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_PPD_INITIATEPICKUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2372400682" "We're nearly done here.  Yeah, we'll get him to booking within the hour."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_RESISTANCESUSPECT_PPD_INITIATEPICKUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3863923491" "Come and get it.  We're almost done here."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTSUSPECT_PPDCALLINFLEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1037505558" "We got a runner!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTSUSPECT_PPDCALLINFLEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1313359050" "He's running!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTSUSPECT_PPDCALLINFLEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2038371817" "Hang on, he ran."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P15950754" "Fancy meeting you here."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P867404395" "When will you guys ever learn?  Wait, you won't."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P84984213" "You are an affront to everything that is good about Praetoria."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3859755771" "You are under arrest.  By the authority of Emperor Cole, I declare your offense to be willfully performed and you will be immediately transported for Tier 2 interrogation upgrade."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P264322083" "What were you thinking trying to run?  Maybe I should send you to Mother Mercy for a psych evaluation."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1550521448" "Well, this hasn't ended quite the way you planned, I'm sure.  Let's continue."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_PPDCALLITIN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P671077715" "I may have another for pickup.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_PPDCALLITIN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2609028015" "We got him.  Prepare to transport."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_PPDCALLITIN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P488013905" "Didn't get away this time.  Send over transport."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_RESISTANCEVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P509395242" "We've done this dance before.  You know you won't be able to keep me."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_RESISTANCEVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1840887465" "Your 'charms' won't work on me, remember?  I'll be gone before transport arrives."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_RESISTANCEVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3958896183" "Such confidence, but I've outrun you before so I don't know where it comes from."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_RESISTANCEVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P568720596" "I must be psychic!  See ya!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_RESISTANCEVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P678750408" "Told youuuuu!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHT_RESISTANCEVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1526189486" "Bye now!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P837043436" "Just once, I want to take them all down, you know?  They ruin the peace of the entire city."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P907036014" "Vigilance.  I know.  We deal with one and three more appear in his place.  They're like breeding rats.  No wonder they like those Tunnels so much."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3577105099" "I believe in what Emperor Cole wants for this city, so it infuriates me when they crawl out of their holes, talking like I don't know what, and scaring ours citizens."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COPCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3973682479" "Every time one of those Resistance crawls out of the Tunnels to tag a building or start up something, they ruin the peace for everyone here.  That's your sister, your cousin, your daughter wandering those streets.  I want them gone."


// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3972438612" "He was just standing there and some guy in a costume ran up and attacked him.  He took one for the team, but when the guy did it again, he took him out.  I mean, what was he supposed to do?  Just stand there and bleed?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P444974296" "If they get aggressive, you give them a chance.  If they continue, you put the full force of the PPD in your 'reply'.  We can't let anyone get the impression that the PPD is unresponsive.  That would be chaos.  Sometimes you have to set an example."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2238863610" "I don't like it either, but it's been happening more lately.  I think some of them are being influenced by those Resistance losers.  I have absolutely no idea why anyone would listen to them. <em>Freaks."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P271014065" "Did you get raid duty, too?  I really love raid duty.  It's like cleaning and disinfecting in one fell swoop."


// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1572180722" "Hm.  I don't see anything here."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3479840077" "Well, this isn't right."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2078675244" "I think it says so right here.  <em> What?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P751620180" "Ok, got that and this and that.  <em> Done."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3502287566" "This just seems to be 'off' to me. <em>Hm."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P511926435" "Looks good. <em> Done."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P30996556" "Disperse!  Or you will be engaged."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P1959772757" "You will disperse now or receive deterrent measures!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P3430454887" "Move along now.  If you continue to loiter you will be physically deterred."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P3158684153" "Keep walking.  There is no loitering about.  Disobedience will be handled swiftly."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P1767041143" "Disperse.  Failure to do so will result in immediate 'physical deterrence'."


// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P572785422" "I don't know what that was.  Keep your firearms at the ready.  We may need to move quickly. <em> You!  Stay back!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P2012328601" "Went that way.  Did you see?  Keep sharp. <em> You there, stay back!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P3931321171" "Keep weapons drawn.  We may have to move quickly.  <em>  You!  Disperse!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P3007006358" "I don't know where they went.  Guns drawn just in case. <em> You!  Get out of here!"



// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1845896319" "It looks okay."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P935149181" "Not much to see.  Looks fine."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2945163176" "Clear here."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P455250993" "We're good here."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1397545631" "You look suspicious, prepare to be detained."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P69846040" "Are you responsible for this?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3900774354" "Copy that, command, I think we have our suspect."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1061027397" "I was just..."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3393791876" "I don't know how you found that out.  It wasn't any big deal."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3971908823" "How did you know that?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1238067070" "What? Who told you?"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P3707985802" "Thanks!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P3890243776" "I've learned my lesson!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P2607404062" "Thank you!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2516243768" "Same person.  Confessed, too."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599454979" "Further instructions?  Got it.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1543067207" "Did you get the data I sent?  Bring him in for Tier 2 interrogation?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P165899055" "Oh, send him there?  Okay."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4040481264" "I think we've got another one."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P845670313" "You there! Submit to questioning or face summary judgement!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P87429317" "This way."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1039992835" "Good day, citizen."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1243120964" "Greetings, citizen."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1217846847" "A beautiful day in Praetoria.  Safe, thanks to Emperor Cole...and us."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_ATTACKED_TEXT :
"P2613325649" "On alert.  You know the drill, guys."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_ATTACKED_TEXT :
"P1116776502" "Prepare for physical force."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_PATROL_ATTACKED_TEXT :
"P2470437175" "Make the smart choice."

// NOVA_ALLHOODS_REINFORCEMENTS_SEERS_SEERREADING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3902406806" "Recording..."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_REINFORCEMENTS_SEERS_SEERREADING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P768293086" "Incoming transmission..."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P1737632958" "But...I didn't think anything WRONG!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P2597762312" "Get away!  Get away!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P1143071146" "Get out of my mind!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P3255428551" "It wasn't my fault!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P268976133" "Stop!  Please!  I didn't mean to think it!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P351628461" "Help me!  Someone help me!  I'm not a criminal!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P1943339245" "Someone!  Tell them!  I did nothing wrong!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P3695943412" "Don't run, Citizen.  You are experiencing unusually high levels of panic.  If you continue at this rate, you will perish."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P387045924" "Please stop running, Citizen."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P3700059211" "Running will only tire you out, Citizen."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P3587546751" "You are unauthorized to interrupt this pursuit."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P1495098618" "You do not have the clearance to interrupt this pursuit."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P4043945166" "Your thoughts have led you down a dangerous path."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1772723598" "Yes, your mother is disappointed in your choice of career."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P377147049" "Your thought verges on inappropriate, Citizen.  Re-evaluate, please."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3765044411" "Emperor Cole approves of that way of thinking, Citizen."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4122922806" "That should be reported to the proper authorities, Citizen.  I have taken the liberty of sending on a transmission for you."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3024532615" "She is not home, Citizen.  Try back later."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1670060384" "Yes, you did leave it on.  You should return to your home now, Citizen."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1739311812" "Be well, Citizen."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P914305043" "Happy thoughts, Citizen."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P22363365" "I detect potential malice, Citizen.  I will respond appropriately."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2623697211" "I detect potential physical harm to my person, Citizen.  I will respond accordingly."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1987870173" "You are having potentially violent thoughts, Citizen.  I will act accordingly."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P223190800" "That will not do."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P386678824" "Yeah, we're good here.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P1255618090" "Situation normal.  Over."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_SHAKEDOWN_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P780114492" "Oh boy are you guys dumb.  This will not end well for you, I can tell you that."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_SHAKEDOWN_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3634035005" "So much for 'resistance'."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_SHAKEDOWN_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2885674473" "You realize how ironic your name is right now, don't you?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_SHAKEDOWN_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2445847587" "Not so important now that you're in custody are you?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_SHAKEDOWN_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2162869887" "You guys are a black mark on Praetoria.  Emperor Cole will not stop until you're eliminated."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_PPD_SHAKEDOWN_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3658511064" "You are the scourge of Praetoria.  An infestation of radicals."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4158128271" "What do we have here? A Resistance sympathizer?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P157096938" "I don't know what you think you just saw, but it'll definitely be the last thing you'll ever see."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3636265747" "Hey! C'mere! I just want to ask you a couple questions."

// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P837473587" "Suspect detained.  Awaiting further instructions."
// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3251554379" "Affirmative.  We're apprehended the suspect.  Transport?"
// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1780866298" "Yes.  We've got him.  Which facility for transport?  Mother Mercy or BAF?"

// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2718934086" "Hold on.  I have some interference here.<em>Move along, please."
// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1522305506" "If you don't vacate the area immediately, I will have to use force."
// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2963993224" "This is an investigation.  Remove yourself from the area or engagement protocols will be enforced."

// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1156553946" "We already have all of the data.  Have you anything else to say?"
// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3289652575" "There is no mistake."
// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2025847448" "I'm sure you have some words in your defense."
// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2718726230" "Well?  What have you got to say for yourself?"

// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2493114951" "Additional suspects present, moving to apprehend."
// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1364863571" "Interfering with a PPD investigation is a violation of Civil Code 1224-A."
// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P8581967" "You there, Citizen! Submit to seizure or face summary judgement!"
// IMPERIALCITY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2988742768" "What did you see? You won't be bringing this back to your Resistance friends."

// IMPERIALCITY_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2204479946" "They couldn't hold me in Nova and they won't hold me here.  You're wasting your time."
// IMPERIALCITY_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3663038398" "I'm tired of this dance.  We need a new song."
// IMPERIALCITY_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3430006027" "You know the drill.  I'll be gone soon."
// IMPERIALCITY_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1999582756" "You know you can never keep me for long."

// IMPERIALCITY_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3569076016" "I'm gone!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1294466265" "See ya!"


// IMPERIALCITY_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2827983207" "Don't resist, you'll only make it harder on yourself."
// IMPERIALCITY_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1478332120" "You just made a big mistake, Citizen."
// IMPERIALCITY_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P683085093" "Take {HeroName} alive! The Praetors will want to interrogate them."
// IMPERIALCITY_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2408711081" "Subdue {HeroName}!"

// IMPERIALCITY_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3503457978" "Clear as a bell.  Over."
// IMPERIALCITY_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P553074647" "No engagements yet.  Over."
// IMPERIALCITY_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3303307388" "I'll let you know if something else comes up."
// IMPERIALCITY_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P472566950" "We'll keep an eye out.  Thanks for the information.  Over."


// IMPERIALCITY_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P624028649" "I'm sure it's a safe house.  We just have to go in and blitz the place, weed them out."
// IMPERIALCITY_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P98016459" "There's been some activity at Yin Corp lately.  We're going to need a few men to go over and check it out."
// IMPERIALCITY_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2753068516" "I saw a few people loitering around Imperial Storage.  If they continue to lollygag, we disperse them."
// IMPERIALCITY_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2015077277" "If I have to go break up another protest, I may just go full protocol on the protesters!"
// IMPERIALCITY_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3488611901" "Yeah, we got one of them locked up at the precinct.  They are CRAZY."


// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1372853636" "Break it up, citizens."
// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P986250929" "Come on, let's go.  Break it up."
// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1126733498" "Show's over.  Please move along now."

// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2133169975" "You were warned."
// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4081613865" "Don't hold back, make an example of them."
// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2983663988" "Disperse! Disperse! Disperse!"
// IMPERIALCITY_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P568056717" "This is an illegal gathering, you risk facing summary judgement."

// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1479569985" "My shift ended about ten minutes ago.  I'm debating putting in for some overtime.  With all that Resistance activity lately, it just makes sense."
// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2340685403" "Want to grab some food before the game?"
// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1065121098" "Yeah, me, too.  But I'm sure they've got it covered."
// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3583851513" "You know?  It never ends.  We work so hard and it just never ends."

// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_WALKIETALKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3620560435" "Wait, I think I've got one."
// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_WALKIETALKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P984303940" "Hold on Control...You there! Stop!"
// IMPERIALCITY_OFFDUTY_WALKIETALKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1542950645" "Control, I think I have a Resistance member in the open, moving to apprehend."

// IMPERIALCITY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3274560779" "No, that's not what I said.  Oh never mind.  Just walk."
// IMPERIALCITY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3316976114" "Last night, on this very route, we had a major blow up with some Resistance.  Keep alert."
// IMPERIALCITY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P80459106" "I'm sure they memorize our routes.  That's how they start things."
// IMPERIALCITY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3964193307" "Just keep your eyes open.  They are too smart to do something right out in the middle of the street."
// IMPERIALCITY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1718796771" "I don't know, dark spaces.  Not right out in the open.  They're not dumb."


// IMPERIALCITY_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P139625128" "Engage!"
// IMPERIALCITY_ROADRUMBLE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
