// IMPERIALCITY_RUMBLESYNDICATE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1029815224" "Everyone in the immediate area!  Let's go!"

// IMPERIALCITY_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1250476526" "I'd be very careful if I were you."
// IMPERIALCITY_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1390960276" "I'm upgrading to Stage 2.  Be very careful."
// IMPERIALCITY_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4161880771" "I have my eye on you."
// IMPERIALCITY_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P506713725" "Now is the perfect time for you to make a very smart choice."

// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P2860806961" "I...my head.  What are you doing?"
// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P3444282975" "Get out of my head!"
// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P3178782196" "How are you doing that?"
// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P1306811178" "What is going on here?"

// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_ESCAPE_TEXT :
"P2798513809" "Aaaaiiieee!"
// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_ESCAPE_TEXT :
"P3123296088" "That wasn't normal!"
// IMPERIALCITY_CITIZEN_INTERROGATED_BY_SEERS_ESCAPE_TEXT :
"P4022392549" "What happened?!"

// IMPERIALCITY_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3639280853" "Good thoughts, Citizen."
// IMPERIALCITY_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4109410319" "Positive thoughts, Citizen."

// IMPERIALCITY_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3041873807" "I detect dishonest intent to my person, Citizen.  I will respond accordingly."

// IMPERIALCITY_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P4135552613" "We're on it.  Over."


// IMPERIALCITY_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P2021471829" "Don't run, Citizen.  You are experiencing unusually high levels of panic."

// IMPERIALCITY_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P1138400952" "You have interrupted official police business."
// IMPERIALCITY_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P1134856205" "Disengage.  Interruption."
// IMPERIALCITY_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P1966259164" "Interruption.  Adjust target."

// NEUTROPOLIS_LEDGE_MUSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P319687631" "Hmmm..."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LEDGE_MUSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P335811031" "See that one?  Want to do a random ID check?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_LEDGE_MUSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P214629598" "I get a feeling that something big's coming down."

// NEUTROPOLIS_LEDGE_MUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P134455523" "Move on, citizen."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LEDGE_MUSING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3247504786" "Move along, citizen."

// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P950322234" "There's been some activity at Hauptman Industries lately.  We're going to need a few men to go over and check it out."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P780308453" "I saw a few people loitering around Keyes Reactor.  If they continue to lollygag, we engage them."

// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4066205762" "Keyes Island is a hotbed of activity lately.  It's been crazy."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2031097810" "We had another attempted breakin at Neuron's HQ.  These guys are getting much bolder."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P49773503" "No, Hauptman was last week.  This week was trouble at the Willingham Water Treatment plant."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3208667614" "Some weird sighting of 'something' near Neuron's building.  I don't know if it's the thing we talked about earlier, but that is creepy."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P346707430" "I don't know what it was.  Its eyes glowed red, that's all I need to know to unlatch the safety."
// NEUTROPOLIS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3956243885" "I have a double shift tonight.  Looks like another trip into the Tunnels later."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P825282207" "You know the drill.  I have so much evidence on you at this point, you'd never leave the BAF.  So, let's just get this done."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3176248350" "Less talking, just hand over what you have."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1111192997" "It's evidence.  Hand it over.  Your anonymous honesty is appreciated."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2876523521" "You didn't see anything."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3272614409" "Don't worry, the Seers will help out later."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3342140887" "The Seers will clean it up."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2667071466" "I don't like this.  My reputation is at stake."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3430961686" "If I am recognized, my career will be over."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1162188553" "Don't you think someone is going to recognize me?  This is my career, officer."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1706349899" "I don't like this at all."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3060736451" "This doesn't feel right.  I don't care how much 'for the good' it is."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2805801805" "See?  I told you!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1676107325" "I knew this would happen!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2786663649" "I knew it!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P782592597" "Was this a setup?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_THREATENING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1287232813" "Easy way or hard way.  Makes no difference to me."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_THREATENING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2421687149" "Either you give the data willingly or I upgrade the protocol."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_THREATENING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1413863171" "Don't think of it as ratting out your colleagues.  Think of it as it is, a service to our city.  That should be at the forefront or your mind."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_THREATENING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P103620722" "Let's clean this up."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_THREATENING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3281866699" "We can't lose the integrity of the investigation.  Clean this up!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_COP_THREATENING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3944817868" "Upgrade protocol!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1936339446" "I really don't think this is a good idea..."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2182952719" "Ack!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_COWERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P715434435" "This is insane!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_COWERING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3116992496" "I knew something like this would happen!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_COWERING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2870818108" "Well, there goes my career!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_COWERING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3707984618" "They saw me!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3325215133" "Secure."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2370641231" "Hm."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3126812948" "I see you."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1120241881" "I've got my eye on you."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4003854746" "Be smart."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3001068181" "Keep moving."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SECURITY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P841548626" "The smartest thing you can do is keep on walking."





// NEUTROPOLIS_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P592420622" "I detect a potential for malice, Citizen.  I will respond appropriately."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P550883026" "That thought will not do."


// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P75830922" "Come on, keep going!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4123788057" "You call that your best?  Let me call my grandmother over.  She can show you how to really do these drills!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3500188704" "I can't believe I've seeing this!  Come ON, people!  Effort!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P9921436" "If you can't be the best, you can't be HERE!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P414124299" "I want MORE!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011674359" "Faster!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4158262201" "FASTER!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2187077926" "Unless you're a new officer recruit, you're in the wrong place.  Keep moving."
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P322003346" "That outfit tells me you don't belong here.  Keep going."
// NEUTROPOLIS_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2276263741" "Keep on walking or I'll set my guys on you."

// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3783412066" "I'm in?  Really?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3703167053" "Wow!  Really?  That's great!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3010107806" "So, what happens next?  Do I get a badge?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1058885927" "Wow, I didn't even sign up and I'm in?  Interesting!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1359245236" "I'm going to join the Praetorian Police Department!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1584628157" "I feel like part of something."
// NEUTROPOLIS_CITIZEN_RECRUITED_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P796275024" "I will do my very best!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1899169547" "You're in.  It's a great honor to be part of the PPD.  Think you can live up to the challenge?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1232802497" "This isn't an easy career, but I think you're up to the challenge."
// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1000302715" "Make me proud, recruit."
// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P392857556" "Welcome to the PPD."

// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1519944100" "Unless you're planning on joining, too, move on."
// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1498909386" "You'll get a lot of people like this.  They just come in and start snooping.  You'll get used to it."
// NEUTROPOLIS_COP_RECRUITING_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P424194580" "Move along, please."

// UNDERGROUND_BATTLEFE_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P1564544061" "This is the Tunnels.  Emperor Cole gives us full protocol access.  So let's go!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLEFE_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3061939347" "No rules down here!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLEFE_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P2198271784" "I've had my eye on you!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLEFE_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P42170746" "Don't think I haven't paid attention to every little thing you've done!  It's going down NOW!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLEFE_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3419783424" "That first hit free rule?  That just ended.  It's on!"

// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3264493484" "Everyone goes down!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3843453447" "If you're in the Tunnels, you're up to no good!  Full protocol!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P4027583179" "Full protocol!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_NORULES_ALERT_CHAT :
"P503403550" "You shouldn't be down here!"

// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_RESISTANCE_BRINGIT_ALERT_CHAT :
"P2709399566" "Let's go, cop!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_RESISTANCE_BRINGIT_ALERT_CHAT :
"P4184170710" "No running this time.  This time, we finish it!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_RESISTANCE_BRINGIT_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3579899280" "A little closer, cop.  I have some physical advice for you!"

// UNDERGROUND_BATTLE_RESISTANCERES_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P150956882" "Everyone who interferes goes down!  I don't care who they are!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLE_RESISTANCERES_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3297026211" "Anyone that jumps in is fair game!  Wanna be safe?  Get out of my way!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLE_RESISTANCERES_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P1774311160" "I don't care who you are!  You mess with me, I take you out!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLE_RESISTANCERES_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P3680808506" "If you're smart, you'll run because I'm not stopping for anything!"

// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P390781074" "Take everyone down!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P1066862426" "Full protocol in effect!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P2017869116" "The boss says we have full access to Stage 3 protocols!"
// UNDERGROUND_BATTLERES_PPD_GOGETHIM_ALERT_CHAT :
"P4193390588" "Take everyone out!"

// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1609648714" "It's too bad you got caught down here.  I can hurt you down here."
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P219814708" "I'll get the information out of you.  I have full access down here."
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3066412725" "Oh, bad luck.  Now if you were up top, well, I'd have to restrain myself. But down here..."
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2108696628" "Bad luck, chum.  This will hurt."

// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1533369155" "It's time!"
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2955650418" "Full protocol in effect!  No one left standing!  If they're down here, they're either Resistance or sympathizers!"
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3560640884" "Everyone is a target!"

// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3664145611" "You have about five seconds until this all goes bad."
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1466544948" "You're not the only one who doesn't have to worry about perception down here.  We going to fight or what?"
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1094452490" "These hands are up now, but in about five seconds they're going to be around your throat."
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2550330928" "Just biding my time.  You know this is going to get physical real soon."

// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1249712120" "Like right about NOW."
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1062013732" "I've put up with you for too long!"
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3205936484" "You can't push us around!  Especially down here!"
// UNDERGROUND_CAUGHT_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P685849011" "Are you nuts?  This is our domain!"


// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1618187693" "It's going to get ugly very very soon."
// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3862854303" "I'd watch your back.  Very dangerous down here.  Someone could get hurt."
// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2466099153" "Watch your step.  Things can go downhill quick down here."
// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2880258006" "Watch your back."
// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3666613055" "I remember you."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3879132183" "We'll get in to their hub, one way or another."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2230290369" "Just set it to blow.  I don't care if we take out a few of them in the process."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1849567491" "Take out a few of their Clockwork while you're taking out the door."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4281694526" "Blow up the whole area, I don't care."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P513451716" "Time for the cleaning crew!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P460890086" "No holds barred!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3532430030" "Oh, this is going to feel good!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_SETUPEQUIP_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1158652903" "You're either Resistance or a sympathizer if you're down here.  Either way, you're going down!"

// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4262933363" "Long halls, lots of darkness."
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P229982668" "I need infrared binoculars down here."
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2294903808" "I can't see a thing."
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1615381215" "I can barely see a thing."
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1985279969" "This seems kind of pointless.  Why can't we just use the security cameras uplinked to our visors?"

// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1857402866" "If you see anyone down here, I mean anyone, it's full attack protocol.  Straight from Emperor Cole's administration."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3029519855" "No.  He said if they're down here, they're probably sympathizing with the Resistance so we have full access for force.  We don't even have to be nice."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P728732391" "I love this assignment.  I get to take out Resistance and I don't even have to get punched first."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1664179047" "The Underground is a dangerous place.  What can I say?  I like it down here.  Attack first, ask questions later."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3083118157" "I just hope someone comes by who shouldn't be here.  Then the real action will start."

// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3507450472" "Hey, what a coincidence."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1554692603" "Aw, that's one big wrong turn you took when you decided to come down here!"
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3809874551" "Sorry, chum, time for some roughing up."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P300943549" "You picked a bad time to come for a visit to the Underground."
// UNDERGROUND_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P703073654" "This isn't going to go very well for you."

// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4188007924" "Eyes out for anything:  creepy stuff, Resistance, trespassers from topside.  Anything."
// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3195621121" "Remember:  we can shoot first and ask questions later if we feel like it.  This is why I love The Underground."
// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3206228337" "Just keep your eyes peeled.  I had one of those 'things' fall on me last week from a duct or vent or something."
// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P812753395" "Think you can hide down here?  Come out come out wherever you are."

// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1703347803" "And here we go!"
// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2160890777" "No questions, just serious bodily harm!"
// UNDERGROUND_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2046911536" "Big mistake!"

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P549139667" "The signal is weak down here. We're navigating by map. Expected time to target is 15 minutes."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2397178143" "We think we've found a door not on the schematics. Might be a hideout, might be an oversight. What are our orders?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P282688881" "The location is confirmed. We're moving out shortly."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3622595278" "I think we've found an alternative route into their hideout. We'll investigate further and contact you soon."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1627536032" "Change of plans. Looks like we may have to engage now."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P457134967" "We may have a situation here. Going silent to deal with the problem."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P2896859115" "Looks like we're going to have to knock some sense into some grunt. I'll call in when we're done."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_MAPCHECK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1920058229" "Looks like we have someone down here who shouldn't be. We're going to deal with it."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2143488570" "We've recovered the rogue Clockwork. None of our men were harmed, but there was some damage to the unit."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P585111195" "I'm not sure what's taking so long. The repair unit says that repairs will be finished shortly."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3639822793" "Why do we need to babysit this unit? The other Clockwork seem to have the repair well in hand."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3650980840" "I think this unit may be too damaged to be repaired out here. Do we have any extraction teams ready to go?"

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3743050360" "We're leaving the unit. We have someone approaching."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1995924640" "We're still authorized for full protocol? Excellent. This punk has made a big mistake then."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1871791114" "We're observing a potentially hostile target. We won't let these Clockwork fall into enemy hands."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P172389546" "Looks like someone's trying to threaten us. Probably some Resistance sympathizer. This is going to be fun."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREDPPD_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P423068831" "Had you guys fooled, didn't I? What's it like, knowing you've all been oblivious to the spy in your midst?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREDPPD_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P1781798087" "Emperor Cole is a fraud. We're taking him down and all of you down, and no one can stop us."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREDPPD_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P2610288588" "What're you waiting for? You guys are always bragging about how you have no rules down here? You scared?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREDPPD_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P733458146" "I'm not the only one. You'll never catch all of us and one day, one of us is going to take out your Emperor."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREDPPD_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P3221115920" "You know I'm going to escape, right? When I do, it'll be your heads that Cole will be after!"

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3199051965" "We got the spy. He won't shutup though. Do we at least have permission to knock him unconscious?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3585125942" "I understand the Emperor wants to deal with the spy personally. Does that mean we can't rough him up a little first, though?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3588962905" "This grunt is a traitor and an insult to the uniform! Why can't we just take care of the problem?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P623527681" "What happened to full protocol? We know he's betrayed us and the Emperor!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3366863400" "Why wait!? Let's just finish this spy scum now!"

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1165266425" "We've got a hostile. We might lose the spy in the crossfire."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1595343364" "Looks like we might have someone else to deal with!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3681776953" "Hold transmission. Someone's down here looking for trouble."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P570859989" "We have a situation to deal with. Going radio silent."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P26124053" "Down here in the Underground, you are to shoot first, ask questions later. There are no rules down here. There are no friends. For as peaceful as it is topside, down here it is war."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P720931847" "All that you know of protocol means nothing down here. You are to act quickly and aggressively in countering all threats."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P3017045429" "We are here to purge the threats to Praetoria where they plot the downfall of our Emperor. No one is innocent here. Do not hesitate to deal with any threat you encounter."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1759530838" "Our orders here are simple. Crush the Resistance. Break-up the Syndicate. Defeat the Destroyers. Eliminate the Ghouls. In the Underground, everything is your enemy, and nothing must be allowed to defeat the PPD."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P3929488771" "This is it! Time to get into the war!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P27816776" "Fight to defend Praetoria!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P1119674649" "This is what we've trained for! Take out all threats!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P3414739993" "Eliminate this threat to Praetoria!"

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1447706876" "We have a man down out here. Can we get a medical team to come extract him?"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P993296085" "I'm not sure who did this. We'll investigate and eliminate all potential suspects."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2064421445" "We need backup out here. We have a man down and we believe the suspects are still nearby."

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1196490689" "Looks like we've found our first suspect!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1903147242" "Take 'em down!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3779818470" "Shoot first, ask questions later!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P226650580" "This might be the one who took out our fellow officer! No mercy!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3106097169" "Eliminate the target!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P3545654230" "We know you're in there. Come out now with your weapons down and your hands up!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P2673949145" "This is your last chance! Open this door or we will apply extreme force!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P3943923676" "No negotiating! Surrender or be executed!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P4208051085" "This is the final warning! Cease and desist or be eliminated!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P13100891" "What are you things?"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P1897938991" "There's no point in reasoning with you, so I'll just have to shoot my way out!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P200146920" "What're you beasts waiting for? Let's finish this!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P500168402" "I'm not dying today!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P3549679336" "I'm going to enjoy finishing you off!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_ALERTED :
"P3963620592" "Full protocol! Everyone goes down!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_ALERTED :
"P1975782264" "You are all under arrest. Submit!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_ALERTED :
"P1077954703" "This is when it gets exciting! Full protocols initiated!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P3538402243" "If this is the best you Resistance punks can do, then you've already lost. Stand down now and I'll make it quick!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P604290295" "I like these odds. You're going to die for sure!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P550520727" "You haven't won, not yet!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P4158242600" "I'm not going to let you walk away from this, so let's just get this over with!"


// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3242224108" "It's a lot more exciting down here than topside."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2034356269" "No rules, no limits. This is why I joined the PPD."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4289512834" "The fighting down here has been more intense lately. We've been warned a war might be coming, but I didn't expect it so soon."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1640888238" "I don't understand why all these fools won't just accept the Emperor. He has given us so much, but they want more!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1986800458" "You should know better than to mess with the PPD!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P293008055" "You just picked the wrong cops to cross!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2054729788" "You're not going to get away with anything down here!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2854427636" "You've just made your last mistake!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4094146658" "I'll never understand what these groups are trying to accomplish? They should all be thankful to Emperor Cole for their lives!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4268352775" "The Destroyers? The Syndicate? The Resistance? I'd say we have our hands full enough without having to deal with those monstrosities."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1453832208" "I just wish we could put them all down in one overwhelming show of force. Keeping this fight to the shadows as much as possible just prolongs this."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2281807765" "I don't know what this Resistance is trying to achieve. They all seem pretty dim-witted to me."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1628835808" "At least when you're fighting the Syndicate or the Destroyers, I know what they say they're fighting for. Even the Ghouls... they just want to eat us. But the Resistance? I can't understand a thing they say. What kind of an organization is that?"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2075941562" "Time for some fun! Full protocol!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P280079655" "Just when my day started to seem a little too quiet! Time for some action!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1308975457" "I've been looking forward to a scrap all day!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2910440601" "You are going to regret this!"

// UNDERGROUND_PPD_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P1379879195" "If anything comes through here, I'm going to shoot to kill."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2516751080" "It's a bit too quiet. Stay alert!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P3970896113" "Did you hear something? I thought I heard a Ghoul crawling nearby."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P1233736760" "This isn't so bad, but all that humming from the generators and whatnot is driving me crazy!"




// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P148557567" "You have just made a big mistake!"
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1647961935" "There's no rules down here, {HeroName}! You're going to get crushed!"
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2197723574" "I'm going to take you down!"
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3492097249" "You shouldn't be here. Full protocol!"
// UNDERGROUND_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3602248720" "If you were looking for a fight, you've found one!"




// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_SYNDICATE_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P3038332364" "You cops think you're going to be able to stop us? The Syndicate owns this city."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_SYNDICATE_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P3107054719" "You're not gonna get anything out of me. All that's going to happen is you're going to end up dead."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_SYNDICATE_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P3917821207" "You can take me in, you can interrogate me, whatever. It doesn't matter, cop, because you're still going to lose."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_SYNDICATE_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P2987712240" "This is our city, cop. If you know what's best for you, you'll just let me go."



// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_DESTROYERS_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P24143272" "Rrraaagh! You cops are making me really angry! Let me go or I'll smash you!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_DESTROYERS_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P2580346869" "Look at you in your armor. Think it makes you tough? You ain't seen tough."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_DESTROYERS_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P4181428972" "You're just lackeys, you know that? Cole and White don't care if you die."
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_DESTROYERS_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
"P2878850944" "Rrraagh! You're gonna regret stoppin' me!"
// UNDERGROUND_PPD_CAPTURE_DESTROYERS_PRISONER_INACTIVE :
