"P284730202" "I need to get to a hidey-hole before I run out of tick-tocks!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHENDEE_RESISTANCE_ALERT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2903539024" "I'm not gonna get squished like you blueberries!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4241766275" "We've caught ourselves a traitor. Requesting permission to send to Lambda for questioning."
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3733964954" "Where should we escort this one to? The Facility? Roger."
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1274413200" "This traitor tried to attack us. I request permission to deal with it right here."

// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2481081831" "Looks like Powers Division is sticking their nose in. I'll get in a good punch for you!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3091594589" "Powers Division freak just showed up. Dealing with it."
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2584297091" "Looks like one of White's people is here!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHENDEE_SYN_ALERT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1653408699" "You cops should know that fortune favors the Syndicate!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHENDEE_SYN_ALERT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P932566508" "I shall be leaving now."
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHENDEE_SYN_ALERT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2532508975" "Luck has not favored you cops today!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_SYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3173941338" "We've caught ourselves a Syndicate criminal. Requesting permission to send to the precinct for questioning."
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_SYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4246990761" "Where should we escort this one to? Lambda Sector? Roger."
// NEUTROPOLIS_APPREHEND_SYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1700540796" "This criminal tried to attack us. I request permission to deal with it right here."


// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P2510331539" "Do not approach this location."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P1698618213" "This area is under security lockdown. Please stay back for your safety."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CORDON_STAYBACK_TEXT :
"P3992515619" "Please step away from this location for your own safety."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CORDON_TOOCLOSE_TEXT :
"P3117575678" "That is too close. Continue your approach and we will respond."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CORDON_TOOCLOSE_TEXT :
"P4180818494" "Do not come any closer!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CORDON_TOOCLOSE_TEXT :
"P919016589" "That is close enough. Step back now!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1988498750" "This ends here, Ghoul!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3471834327" "We have only one rule when fighting you Ghouls: kill on sight!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2095964689" "This is for all my brothers' you've killed!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P2959519192" "You should not be getting involved! This is my fight!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P4135572381" "Back off, Powers Division!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P2031744878" "Don't you dare come and steal my kill!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2415735983" "I'm going to enjoy breaking every bone in your body, traitor!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1948402587" "Do you really think you're going to win?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2442227143" "The Resistance! Look at you! You're pathetic!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P3435394974" "You just had to go make this your fight, didn't you?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P4005417784" "You should know better than to interfere, Powers Division!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P724364348" "Looks like I'll get to take out a super-powered freak too!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_SYN_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P4095065910" "First, I'm taking you down. Then, your whole organization!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_SYN_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1588726624" "The Syndicate will submit to the will of Emperor Cole!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_SYN_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P58843884" "You have gotten away with your crimes for too long. This ends now!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_SYN_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P608014790" "Your interference will not be tolerated!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_SYN_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P3129913017" "You want a fight, do you? Well, you've got one!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_BATTLE_SYN_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P2420159818" "This punk is mine! I'm not letting you steal from me!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3652735322" "We have our methods. One way or another, you will tell us what we want to know."
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3182088357" "You can do this the easy way or the hard way."
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1819756574" "Tell us what you know about their plans! I'm not going to give you another chance!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P210220632" "This is not your concern!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P637969409" "Back off! We have the situation under control!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3898087738" "The PPD does not require your assistance!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2581883052" "C'mon, badger. Being a pet can't be that super-shiny!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2661326096" "What're you doing, badger?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1139822497" "All you blueberries are gonna get squished!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P80812476" "You're gonna get all red and squishy now, badger!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2526902081" "Time for some blueberry smashin'!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2482309701" "Let's get burstin' this blueberry then zip to the hidey-hole!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3374743756" "I'm gettin' out of here. Later, badger!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2169613412" "This pot's too hot! I'm gettin' out and coolin' in the hidey-hole!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_RESISTANCE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2950893091" "Enough zappin'! I'll be zippin'!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_SYN_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1088998536" "Where is Mr. Yin! Where is Tub Ci!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_SYN_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3447896129" "You are going to tell us the codes to get into Yin Corp!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_SYN_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2060948113" "Enough stalling! Tell us when the shipment is coming in!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_SYN_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1767361698" "What do you think you're doing? Back off!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_SYN_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1573388542" "Your assistance is not needed!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_CAUGHT_SYN_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3999536960" "Do not interfere with my investigation!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3837663961" "This was an unwise decision on your part, cop."
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P273322196" "You will not live to regret this. I assure you of that."
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1911492622" "This interference in Syndicate affairs will hasten your demise, cop."

// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P745416032" "Your time has run out."
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3228473323" "Fate has decreed that this be your end!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2943003689" "Fortune does not smile on you today!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P231658021" "This is not over. We will be back!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1857127204" "The Syndicate will prevail. Praetoria will be ours!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_BRAWL_SYN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3603872914" "Don't think this is over. The war is only just begun!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P948704168" "This one isn't authorized."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1524264731" "I can't seem to find their name on the list."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_WRITECLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P4203007249" "The papers seem to be in order, but something just seems off."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P1137195760" "We have this under control. Your assistance is not needed."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P1953612606" "Nothing to see here, Powers Division. Don't you have somewhere else to be?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_CHECKPOINT_STANDBACKORCOMBAT_TEXT :
"P2004880611" "No need to get involved. We can handle this."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3938565974" "Citizens! You are hereby ordered to cease and desist!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1150957272" "Enough of this, citizens. Return to your homes before action is taken!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2614596705" "Protests are illegal in Praetoria. Return to your homes or the use of force will be authorized!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P851235563" "You have had your warning! Fire!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3948380014" "No more warnings! Fire!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_DISPERSEPROTESTERS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1195602484" "It is time to face the consequences of your defiance!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3837225732" "Neutropolis is so depressing. Even the coffee tastes toxic here. I wish we'd be given the go ahead to just wipe it out and start clean."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3880901021" "If you ask me, Neuron and Anti-Matter aren't to be trusted. Look what they've done to Neutropolis!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2210274545" "A buddy of mine was saying that they're recruiting for a special program. Sounds like they're training some super soldiers. I'm thinking I might give it a shot."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1739879992" "Do you have a problem, Powers Division?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1818253553" "What do you want, you super-powered freak?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1164506923" "Do not get between me and my break, 'hero'."

// NEUTROPOLIS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3093420559" "I'd watch your back.  Very dangerous out here in Neutropolis.  Someone could get hurt."
// NEUTROPOLIS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2981795561" "Watch your step.  Things can go downhill in Neutropolis."


// NEUTROPOLIS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2733221603" "Do not attempt to interfere."
// NEUTROPOLIS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3117796128" "Your assistance is not needed. Please leave this area."
// NEUTROPOLIS_FLASHLIGHTSEARCH_FLASHLIGHTGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P100349385" "This is an active investigation. Please leave immediately!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P959267460" "Our orders are simple, men. We are to eradicate the Ghouls and crush the Resistance. If you happen to also take down some Syndicate, there'll be a commendation in your file."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P4032215336" "It looks like we have The Destroyers under control, no thanks to Powers Division. Here in Neutropolis, however, we've got the Resistance out in force. This is where we root them out for good!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1660912737" "The Ghouls are a problem at night, so we need to find where they hide during the day. If we get them there, we can stop these nightly attacks for good."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P2295253858" "We do not require your assistance, Powers Division. Please leave."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P1171797005" "The PPD has everything under control. We do not need your help, so leave!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P2982898794" "Back off. This is classified information for PPD officers only!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1717256277" "Leave before we place you under arrest!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P221467695" "Keep away or we will be forced to respond."
// NEUTROPOLIS_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P448366925" "For your safety, we advise you to leave immediately!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3396856016" "Do not persist in this behavior or you will face the penalty."
// NEUTROPOLIS_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2624595382" "Step back immediately!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2271720843" "Look, I swear I had nothing to do with whatever it is you think I did."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3232024439" "I don't know anyone in the Resistance! I'm no traitor!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P625379432" "Please just let me go. I haven't done anything wrong!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P844402503" "I'm getting out of here!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P4112956748" "I don't want to get in the middle of this!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATION_CITIZENCHATTING_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P558483644" "I don't want any trouble!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P801996226" "Where should we take this one?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2714018964" "Swears up and down they had nothing to do with it. We may need a Seer to investigate."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2900601579" "This one's denying everything. Requesting permission to escalate our questioning."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1540925286" "Looks like someone from Powers Division wants to muscle in on this investigation."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4074883890" "Step away. This is our investigation."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_PPD_INVESTIGATOR_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1092838414" "Back off, Powers Division. This is our collar."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P674910639" "You want these bodies for food? These are my fellow officers! You're going to have to get through me first!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P1623251092" "I'm not letting you monsters take away my brother officers!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_INACTIVE :
"P290930702" "This isn't over. I'm going to eliminate all of you monsters!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_ALERTED :
"P679499130" "Back off! This is my fight!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_ALERTED :
"P2126999389" "I'm not going to let you steal this from me! These monsters are mine!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDFE_ALERTED :
"P4258172309" "Looks like I'll get to take down a Powers Division grunt too!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P3907619626" "You traitors! I'm going to enjoy killing you!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P105719960" "Resistance scum! This isn't over!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_INACTIVE :
"P1552565499" "I'm not letting any of you traitors escape! This ends now!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_ALERTED :
"P3718842730" "No! These traitors are mine!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDRES_ALERTED :
"P3801563287" "I'm not letting you steal credit for these traitors! They're my ticket to a promotion!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDSYN_INACTIVE :
"P2461395655" "I'm not going to go easily, criminals!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDSYN_INACTIVE :
"P3283907155" "Think you've won? Think again!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDSYN_INACTIVE :
"P2856259456" "You won't take me alive!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDSYN_ALERTED :
"P1318851755" "What are you doing? This is my fight!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDSYN_ALERTED :
"P2684745730" "Did I ask for your help, Powers Division?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_LASTSTANDSYN_ALERTED :
"P3305305600" "Another 'hero' getting in the way of the PPD. I think it's time I dealt with this!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3465619127" "I'm really tired of these Powers Division fools acting like they own the place."
// NEUTROPOLIS_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2769525504" "I think the Emperor should just eliminate all the super-powered grunts. They're too much trouble."
// NEUTROPOLIS_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4216240471" "If these Powers Division folks are so tough, how come we're the ones who have to deal with all these gangs trying to overrun the city?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_OFFDUTY_WALKIETALKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1325003713" "We may have a situation down here."
// NEUTROPOLIS_OFFDUTY_WALKIETALKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2364428591" "Looks like one of White's lackeys wants to tangle."
// NEUTROPOLIS_OFFDUTY_WALKIETALKIE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3190380690" "I think we might have a problem with one of White's 'heroes'."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4246810431" "You have come too close. I will respond."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1020550480" "No, I assure you, it would not be easy to defeat me."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3400845989" "Your thoughts betray you. Hostile intentions will not be tolerated."


// NEUTROPOLIS_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3165193728" "Do not approach any closer!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1836575316" "Do not interfere with an active investigation!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1995171968" "Do not persist in harassing me or action will be taken."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKA_INACTIVE :
"P1828450894" "Why am I doing this? Can't Antimatter just snap his fingers and make the change?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKA_INACTIVE :
"P974842242" "These Antimatter clockwork are different than the others I've worked on before. I don't know if this will work."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKA_INACTIVE :
"P1396781531" "This is way harder than they made it seem back at the tower. I have no idea if this is going to work."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKN_INACTIVE :
"P2538933862" "Neuron's got his own army of these things. Why am I the one doing this?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKN_INACTIVE :
"P76247206" "This Neuron clockwork is nothing like the regular ones. There's way more here than I've ever seen. This may not work!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKN_INACTIVE :
"P3009535756" "Well, if I got this right, this thing will help us a lot. It'll go in guns blazing."

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKL_INACTIVE :
"P2385953916" "Shouldn't the Clockwork being doing this themselves? Why do I have to do this?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKL_INACTIVE :
"P113425039" "One of the guys back at the precinct said this will make these things fight better. It had better work."

// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_GENERAL_THREATEN_POWERSDIVISION :
"P135887788" "What do you think you're doing? This is our arrest!"
// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_GENERAL_THREATEN_POWERSDIVISION :
"P599596924" "You Powers Division think you always need to get involved. Big mistake."
// IMPERIALCITY_APPREHEND_GENERAL_THREATEN_POWERSDIVISION :
"P2576872214" "You're interfering with our arrest! Full protocol!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPD_ANGRYWITHPLAYER_ALERTED :
"P820615527" "You'd better get out of here, Powers Division! This is our arrest!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPD_ANGRYWITHPLAYER_ALERTED :
"P3034270062" "Think you're better than me, Powers Division? How about I teach you a lesson?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_ARRESTWALL_PPD_ANGRYWITHPLAYER_ALERTED :
"P3107172982" "I've had it with you Powers Division lackeys interfering! You're going down!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHTRES_PPD_ANGRYWITHPLAYER_ALERTED :
"P74388485" "I'm not taking orders from you Powers Division! You're going down!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHTRES_PPD_ANGRYWITHPLAYER_ALERTED :
"P1062766623" "Powers Division! You're not getting credit for our takedown!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_CAUGHTRES_PPD_ANGRYWITHPLAYER_ALERTED :
"P7563208" "I'm so sick of Powers Division sticking their nose in. Full protocol!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKA_ALERTED :
"P2003507339" "Let's see what this thing can do."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKA_ALERTED :
"P1646542910" "Hmmm. Powers Division. Might be a good way to test these tweaks."
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKA_ALERTED :
"P1131643130" "Looks like it's ready. Now, time for a test!"


// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKL_ALERTED :
"P3066370892" "Well, let's see what this thing can do!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_PPD_RECONFIGURE_CWKL_ALERTED :
