// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_INACTIVE :
"P2658120354" "You traitors should be thankful for the mercy shown by Emperor Cole."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_INACTIVE :
"P1824980318" "Traitors the lot of you. Be thankful Emperor Cole is so forgiving."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_INACTIVE :
"P1938603739" "If I were in charge, you'd all be hanging from the tallest tower I could find. You should be thankful for the Emperor's mercy!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_ALERTED :
"P90514289" "What is this? You should not be in here!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_ALERTED :
"P744655193" "What do you think you're doing in here?"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_ALERTED :
"P443235471" "Powers Division or no, you should not have come here. You're going down!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_EXECUTE_RESISTANCE_PPD_OVERSEER_INACTIVE :
"P2604281416" "Ready, men!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_EXECUTE_RESISTANCE_PPD_OVERSEER_INACTIVE :
"P3684335477" "Any last words, traitors?"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_EXECUTE_RESISTANCE_PPD_OVERSEER_INACTIVE :
"P4180684724" "We will give you one last chance. Tell us where we can find Calvin Scott and you will be shown mercy!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_EXECUTE_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_ALERTED :
"P2419652130" "We have an intruder! Get them!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_EXECUTE_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_ALERTED :
"P2042653323" "You have no rights here. I'm going to enjoy taking you out, Powers Division!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_EXECUTE_RESISTANCE_LINEUP_PPD_OVERSEER_ALERTED :
"P2319687011" "You should not have come here. Now you're going to pay!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4091708279" "This is one of the better details in the city. The freedom of the Underground without the constant threat of Ghouls. I like it."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3819878652" "I have to say, I knew there were a lot of Resistance traitors... but this many? We should make an example of them all."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_OFFDUTY_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1719497943" "This is a good detail, but I don't know why we're keeping them alive. We should just execute every traitor, not just the worst offenders."

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_OFFDUTY_TALKER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3057387370" "How did you get in here!?"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_OFFDUTY_TALKER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3395588300" "Looks like we have ourselves a new prisoner!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_OFFDUTY_TALKER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2281128761" "Full protocol! Take 'em down!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P688426852" "I sense that you do not belong here."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3270676401" "You should not be here. You know it. I know it."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SEERS_POST_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P736950710" "I see your thoughts. You would be wise to reconsider your plan."

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE'_TEXT :
"P1061515353" "If anyone tries anything, I'm going to shoot first and ask questions later."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE'_TEXT :
"P1833285593" "This is a good assignment. Way better than when I was in the Underground."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_DUOGUARD_INACTIVE'_TEXT :
"P3175376501" "I hope someone tries to escape. I want to get back into those live fire situations like in Neutropolis."

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2222866131" "You will never escape this Facility!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1038850160" "Coming here is the last mistake you will ever make!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P303394151" "You will never get off this island!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ALERTED :
"P3177012824" "Do not let this intruder escape!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ALERTED :
"P2050278743" "Eliminate this intruder!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ALERTED :
"P3981326584" "No restrictions. We cannot let this fool leave here alive!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2818300192" "At the Behavioral Adjustment Facility, we are to ensure that no one without authorization leaves these premises. Anyone suspicious is to be detained or eliminated."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1644419954" "You are here because you have shown exemplary skill and loyalty. Here you are trusted to maintain that loyalty and mete out the Emperor's justice."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P632593628" "Do not waver in your duty. We deal with traitors and scum every day here, but our loyalty and honor must prevail."


// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SINGLEGUARD_ALERTED :
"P2614079077" "This facility is under our authority. Surrender or face immediate punishment!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SINGLEGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3502120998" "You should never have come here!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SINGLEGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1073511379" "You are under arrest!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1926500687" "Trespassing on Imperial property is a capital offense."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2406988726" "You are trespassing on Imperial property. Surrender at once or face summary execution!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_WANDER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3071670914" "You have no rights here! Time to die!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4189557333" "I've only got another week on my assignment here, then I get rotated into Neutropolis. I am not looking forward to that."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1142983126" "This is a lot better than being out there. On the streets, it's all about the citizens. Here, it's all about justice."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1822436062" "I'm looking forward to getting away from this place. I want to get back into the real fighting out there."

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3109650618" "This is what we train for! Take 'em down!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P181759895" "This one's seen too much! We can't allow 'em to escape!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P169361229" "We've got a break-in! Full protocol!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P243003841" "The coffee here is so much better than at the precinct."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1073430581" "This place doesn't seem that exciting on the surface, but it's way more interesting underground. You'll see."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2139409731" "It's not as bad as it seems. We get to do whatever we want here. No citizens protesting, no Powers Division getting in the way. Just us and the traitors."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3892977067" "You're going to regret interrupting my break!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_PPD_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3161121156" "You should never have come here. Now, you're never going to leave!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3539479139" "We have ourselves an intruder!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2745007621" "You will never escape this place!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_GUARDDUTY_BINOCULAR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P994577027" "You're going to regret coming here, Powers Division!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P945695537" "This is it! Full protocol!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1044787316" "This one shouldn't be here! No holding back! Don't let 'em escape!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_BAF_GUARDDUTY_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3185601178" "Coming here is the last thing you will ever do!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3649663229" "If we're lucky, some traitors will try to escape. Then we can just take 'em out, rather than keep 'em locked up!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2438048840" "I don't know, but I think I prefer the Underground. There's always something to shoot at down there."

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P942703862" "Don't resist, you'll only make it harder on yourself!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2925863600" "You made a big mistake coming here!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1380103712" "Don't let this one escape!"

// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1678615001" "I know what it is you are trying to do. You will be stopped!"
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P799785934" "I know of your plans. They end here."
// IMPERIALCITY_BAF_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2566911557" "You will not escape this place. Submit and you might live!"

// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P343851403" "You're all pathetic! Do you think you're ready to go toe to toe with the Carnival of Light!?!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1744810164" "You're supposed to be the best of the best! You drill like a bunch of old ladies!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3759071424" "This is counter-insurgency training 101, ladies! You couldn't capture a taco stand!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3180751837" "You're embarrassing me, soldiers! You think the Resistance is gonna lay down and let you walk all over them?"

// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3331201405" "Alright men, this isn't a drill, you know what to do!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P604957920" "Hostiles!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2319126145" "Remember your training and you will make it out alive!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3902172342" "This is what we trained for, men!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1381751631" "Looks like they brought the fight to us!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1425856822" "This is not an exercise!"
// FIRSTWARD_DRILL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P993207549" "Engage the enemy!"

