// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P4060846573" "Fascists!"
// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P2612842330" "Leave us alone!"
// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P651652965" "Die!"
// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P1488414143" "We have a message for Cole, and you get to be the messengers! DIE!"

// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P428733875" "Engaging the enemy."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P3434450052" "Commencing counter-insurgency exercise."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_INACTIVE :
"P1599061303" "Aren't these just civilians?"

// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P2051241331" "Help us!"
// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P485708666" "You're in for it now!"
// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P270553323" "Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!"
// FIRSTWARD_PCF_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P1674408975" "Just in time!"

// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P1405218547" "Squad to base, we've encountered hostiles."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P1097637205" "It's an ambush!"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P3896123938" "Squad to base, we've hit an ambush."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P4238180945" "More?"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P800249667" "Where'd they come from?"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P924166799" "New targets! Fire! Fire! Fire!"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_COUNTERINSURGENCY_ALERTED :
"P2921087590" "Enemy backup inbound!"

// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P677980503" "Can you believe the way the people live out here? I'd shoot myself."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P1293215617" "You got to give it to the Eltentowners, though, they don't give up."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P642414531" "Did you hear that Squad K hasn't reported back in two days? Echelon is keeping it quiet."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P2519012433" "I've heard that the reason we're here isn't to learn how to fight the Resistance, it's for something else, something weirder."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P4015334480" "I hear they're training us for some kind of off-world op."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P1970666191" "Did you hear something?"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P1701342048" "Ever wonder why they never rehabilitated First Ward? I mean, seems like a waste of prime real estate just to train a bunch of grunts."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P3515525472" "So I was thinking the other day, what if these people, these Eltentowners aren't the criminals Echelon tells us they are, what if they're just people caught up in something beyond their control?"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P422969343" "Actually, I have more respect for these Eltentowners than the citizens back in Nova or Imperial. These people actually have the guts to defend what they have, instead of letting the state hold their hand for them."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P2897099666" "That's bordering on treasonous talk, there soldier."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_CAMP_INACTIVE :
"P992744149" "I hope we run up against one of those Carnival freaks. I'd love to take one of those masks as a souvenir."


// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P1148999180" "Thought slaves, do not impede us."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P1739254500" "You have been wronged, join us in vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P1014036443" "Tools of the usurper, we must destroy you."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P4145686654" "I know your masters can hear us through you. Know this: you cannot stop us."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P2900958125" "Cole, we are coming for you."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P2672910956" "These are mere instruments of the oathbreaker, do not waste yourselves to battle them."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P2141122700" "None shall escape our wrath, not even you."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P3627866848" "There are no innocents."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_INACTIVE :
"P1877435396" "More thought slaves."

// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_ALERTED :
"P3178200635" "What's this? More agents of the usurper."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_ALERTED :
"P4214319053" "Who are these? Agents of the betrayer?"
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_ALERTED :
"P2805216716" "Do you fight for the oathbreaker? Then join him in Hades."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_ALERTED :
"P2308732024" "You cannot save them."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_ALERTED :
"P2696505622" "More subjects for our holy vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_TOV_BATTLE_SEERS_ALERTED :
"P4122319175" "Our righteous vengeance will consume you all."




// FIRSTWARD_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P381115368" "Hours of boredom punctuated by moments of sheer terror, yeah I've heard that before."
// FIRSTWARD_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P6934556" "Radioing in, all quiet here."
// FIRSTWARD_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P330690917" "Man, this place gives me the creeps."
// FIRSTWARD_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2674732790" "Looking around, I still wonder why they didn't just rebuild the place."
// FIRSTWARD_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4092617051" "Here? Nope, not here."


// FIRSTWARD_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P2160244808" "Help!"
// FIRSTWARD_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P3619701281" "Stay away!"
// FIRSTWARD_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P1122921677" "Please, I didn't do anything!"
// FIRSTWARD_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P2075159990" "Can't...run....much...longer...."
// FIRSTWARD_CITIZEN_CHASED_BY_SEERS_TEXT :
"P3647242269" "Why are you doing this to me?"

// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P1157043472" "Prepare to be processed."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P677561513" "Your guilt is inherent to your condition."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P3522503113" "I sense your treasonous thoughts."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P20947391" "The Cole Administration appreciates your cooperation."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_TEXT :
"P3990881422" "Halt, citizen."

// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P2421426586" "Do not interfere."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P1429234256" "We act on the authority of the Cole Administration."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P4215700468" "More guilt, adjusting capture parameters."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P4189262707" "I sense treasonous thoughts."
// FIRSTWARD_SEERS_CHASING_CITIZEN_INTERRUPTED_TEXT :
"P499731707" "Citizen, stand down from this action or lethal force will be authorized."

// FIRSTWARD_DUST_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1247120246" "You Resistance don't give up do you?"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1953803817" "More Resistance? I thought we stomped your asses in Neutropolis."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1497266699" "You Resistance are like cockroaches."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2902488797" "And here I thought I'd never get to stomp me some Resistance."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3691476614" "Did Cole ship you guys in just for target practice?"
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P4254684978" "I'm going to enjoy this."




// FIRSTWARD_DUST_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2240483989" "We'll be going house to house today, men. This is a standard infiltration and extermination exercise."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1632507018" "Even though the Resistance tends to stay off the streets during the day, always be aware of the potential for ambushes."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P3746491468" "We'll be doing a standard sweep near the enemy stronghold. We expect enemy engagement to be sporadic, but you know what to expect."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2309423332" "There have been an uptick in the number of ghouls sightings, so be aware of your surroundings, they can come from anywhere."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P3521853244" "Since we eliminated a Resistance patrol last night, expect there to be reprisals all along the Eltentown border."
// FIRSTWARD_DUST_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2886182784" "I want you pairing up in teams of two. We'll be doing door to door sweeps and clearing out any hostiles we encounter."


// FIRSTWARD_SEER_CAPTURE_POS_INACTIVE :
"P2132320386" "Praetor Tilman wishes this one to remain intact for study. Be gentle."
// FIRSTWARD_SEER_CAPTURE_POS_INACTIVE :
"P541441677" "You will serve to aid the Praetor's research well."
// FIRSTWARD_SEER_CAPTURE_POS_INACTIVE :
"P199288772" "Your possession makes you a candidate for extraction. Please remain calm while we transport you to the hospital."
// FIRSTWARD_SEER_CAPTURE_POS_INACTIVE :
"P856808601" "Do not struggle, possessed. Praetor Tilman only wishes to aid you."

// FIRSTWARD_SEER_CAPTURE_POS_ALERTED :
"P215927447" "You should not have interfered in our work here."
